-BA8F-5E3AE9920D3A","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"telop":"「急な要望に答えていただき、ありがとうございます。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AD%E5%A4%9C%E5%92%B2%E5%A4%9C","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","duration":3.526984126984127,"voiceDuration":2.926984126984127,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc213186_紅魔館ロビー.pxd"},{"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/_11__75a569f27f\/_11__75a569f27f.004.jpeg","title":"シーン 4","backgroundName":"nc213186_紅魔館ロビー.jpeg","slideTitle":"スライド #4","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_004_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.7,"id":"5CD425B4-3C69-4F52-9559-B4F1C19782A0","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"telop":"「いえいえ、それでフレラさんは、今どこにいますか？」\n制作ソフト及び協力\nGemini\nTohoStuido","seStartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","duration":3.8256462585034012,"voiceDuration":3.225646258503401,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc213186_紅魔館ロビー.pxd"},{"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/_11__75a569f27f\/_11__75a569f27f.005.jpeg","title":"シーン 5","backgroundName":"nc213186_紅魔館ロビー.jpeg","slideTitle":"スライド #5","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_005_十六夜咲夜.wav","bgmVolume":0.7,"id":"E145788A-9ACE-4A70-9DB7-A1DDD40046E6","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"telop":"「妹様なら、図書館にいると思いますよ。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AD%E5%A4%9C%E5%92%B2%E5%A4%9C","voice2StartTimeOffset